---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="友情链接" description="与认真写作的人交换链接。">
  <section class="friends container">
    <p class="folio">FRIENDS / 003</p>
    <h1>友情链接</h1>
    <p class="lead">这里会收录长期写作、内容原创且可以正常访问的个人站点。列表正在整理中，宁可暂时留白，也不放占位链接。</p>

    <div class="empty-state">
      <span aria-hidden="true">00</span>
      <div>
        <h2>等待第一位邻居</h2>
        <p>如果你也在维护个人博客，欢迎附上站点名称、地址和一句简介，通过 GitHub 与我联系。</p>
        <a href="https://github.com/LLLLLei073" target="_blank" rel="noopener">前往 GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="rules" aria-labelledby="rules-title">
      <h2 id="rules-title">交换原则</h2>
      <ol>
        <li><span>01</span>站点可以稳定访问，并支持 HTTPS。</li>
        <li><span>02</span>主要内容由作者本人创作，而非批量转载。</li>
        <li><span>03</span>不包含恶意下载、诱导广告或明显侵权内容。</li>
      </ol>
    </section>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .friends {
    padding-top: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 7rem);
    padding-bottom: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 7rem);
  }

  .folio {
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
  }

  .lead {
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: 2rem 0 3.5rem;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .empty-state {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(100px, 0.35fr) 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem) 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--card-foreground);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .empty-state > span {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(4rem, 9vw, 7rem);
    line-height: 0.85;
    color: var(--border-400);
  }

  .empty-state h2 {
    margin: 0 0 0.8rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.35rem);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .empty-state p {
    max-width: 500px;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .empty-state a {
    display: inline-flex;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    min-height: 44px;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .rules {
    margin-top: 4rem;
  }

  .rules h2 {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .rules ol {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .rules li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 3rem 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 0.9rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
  }

  .rules li span {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--primary);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .friends {
      padding: 3rem 1rem 4rem;
    }

    .empty-state {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
